WEBVTT

00:05:29.148 --> 00:05:32.248
Na kila mtu mara moja akaitikia

00:05:32.272 --> 00:05:36.595
kwa kutoa sumu
itakayoua ile familia nyingine.

00:05:36.619 --> 00:05:38.387
[Ondoa!]

00:05:40.129 --> 00:05:42.261
(Kicheko)

00:05:43.338 --> 00:05:47.731
Wakina Capulet wakajibu kwa
kuita shambulizi la kujibu.

00:05:47.755 --> 00:05:48.911
[Shambulia!]

00:05:48.935 --> 00:05:50.360
Na wakawa na vita.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:56.708
Hii ni video ya bakteria wa ukweli
wakipigana na viumbe kama upanga,

00:05:56.732 --> 00:05:58.345
ambapo wanajaribu kuuana

00:05:58.369 --> 00:06:01.207
kwa kuchomana kihalisi
na kupasuana wenyewe.